paragraph start
todo: open notation requires a title for every box type
So that focus level 2 can show a title for each box type, the notation system has to require a title for every box type. This changes AIU NOTATION, a sibling folder, so it is a decision to take there and not a patch from the editor. Owner request 2026-11-01.
paragraph end
